    "title": "All charges dropped against Springdale man arrested at borough council meeting - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Haley Daugherty ,\n18 hours ago All charges were withdrawn against a Springdale man accused of disrupting a borough council meeting and resisting arrest in April. Allegheny County District Attorney’s office officials dropped the charges against William “Danny” Rosenmund at a scheduled preliminary hearing on the matter Wednesday before District Judge Michael Girardi in Harmar. Read full article",
